WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,720
Ouch, what did I miss?

2
00:00:01,720 --> 00:00:02,920
Please have tea

3
00:00:02,920 --> 00:00:06,360
You can also eat the fruits on the table. You're welcome. Thank you.

4
00:00:06,360 --> 00:00:07,560
This woman is so beautiful

5
00:00:07,560 --> 00:00:09,040
Not putting pressure on myself at all

6
00:00:09,040 --> 00:00:11,080
I don’t know what position I hold in the company

7
00:00:11,080 --> 00:00:12,880
How did these two bastards get so rich?

8
00:00:12,880 --> 00:00:13,960
The interview was so funny

9
00:00:13,960 --> 00:00:15,280
Pay according to appearance

10
00:00:15,280 --> 00:00:16,280
It's simply ridiculous

11
00:00:16,280 --> 00:00:19,000
This is the goddess I have been chasing for four years without success.

12
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:20,160
But today it seems

13
00:00:20,160 --> 00:00:21,640
The appearance is not invincible either

14
00:00:21,640 --> 00:00:23,240
Compare with the smiling beauties

15
00:00:23,240 --> 00:00:24,160
There are still some differences

16
00:00:24,160 --> 00:00:26,360
Brother Tong already has two smiling beauties by his side.

17
00:00:26,360 --> 00:00:27,960
It shouldn't be difficult for me to chase an ordinary smiling flower.

18
00:00:27,960 --> 00:00:29,800
The neighbor next door hanged himself on this tree

19
00:00:29,800 --> 00:00:31,180
Let's start

20
00:00:31,180 --> 00:00:33,440
This interview is mainly about you

21
00:00:33,440 --> 00:00:35,040
Thank you boss beauty

22
00:00:35,040 --> 00:00:36,780
Please introduce yourself

23
00:00:36,780 --> 00:00:38,340
My name is Tan Jia

24
00:00:38,340 --> 00:00:39,900
I had known it would be today

25
00:00:39,900 --> 00:00:41,740
I agreed to his pursuit in the past

26
00:00:41,740 --> 00:00:43,820
Can I have an annual salary of one million today?

27
00:00:43,820 --> 00:00:45,140
Since you already have a job

28
00:00:45,140 --> 00:00:46,740
There is no need to occupy resources

29
00:00:46,740 --> 00:00:49,660
Other beauties need work more, Luo Ming

30
00:00:49,660 --> 00:00:51,340
I have never accepted your pursuit before

31
00:00:51,340 --> 00:00:52,940
But I am willing to get to know you again

32
00:00:52,940 --> 00:00:54,700
I hope it depends on our previous relationship.

33
00:00:54,700 --> 00:00:57,140
Give him a chance and chase him after all
